{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-media#card-zh","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-media","commit":"d1b8f969fca962131a3595441e47edbc6f51e573","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-media 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的本地媒体与文档处理插件。它在 DSH 中注册一组工具，并向系统提示说明可用的媒体操作。主要功能包括探测音视频和图片信息、从媒体抽取音轨并生成缩略图、读取 PDF 文本、调用 Whisper 转录音频，以及使用 pandoc、tesseract 和 exiftool 做格式转换、OCR 与元数据读取。适合需要在 DSH 工作流中查看或转换本机文件的用户。使用前需在 PATH 中安装相应命令行工具；无需 API Key 或外部账号，文件需位于允许的目录中。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:13-32","index.js:34-53","lib/media.js:84-99","lib/media.js:101-223"]}
{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-media#card-en","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-media","commit":"d1b8f969fca962131a3595441e47edbc6f51e573","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-wsl-media adds local media tools to DSH. It registers tools in the system prompt. Users can inspect files, extract audio, make thumbnails, read PDFs, transcribe audio, convert documents, run OCR, and view metadata. Install the needed local command-line tools; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:13-32","index.js:34-53","lib/media.js:84-99","lib/media.js:101-223"]}
